    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BARRY AUCTIONEERS & VALUERS are delighted to bring to the market this exceptional contemporary residence with spectacular views over Cork Harbour, positioned at the top of Church Hill in Passage West.\r\nThe property extends to approximately 3,600 sq ft, this impressive six-bedroom, five-bathroom home combines generous proportions with an outstanding standard of finish. Finished to the highest specification, it offers a refined modern setting for family living and entertaining.\r\nThe elevated position is a defining feature, with breath-taking harbour views providing a remarkable backdrop to everyday life. The scale of the accommodation, contemporary style and meticulous attention to detail give this home a distinctive sense of quality throughout.\r\nThis is a superb opportunity to acquire a substantial modern residence in this most sought after location . This is a home where space, exceptional finish and magnificent views come together.\r\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the quality and setting of this outstanding property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance hall - \r\nsolid wooden floors\r\n\r\nGuest wc - \r\nWc & Whb, tiled floors and walls \r\n\r\nUtility room - \r\n Plumbed for washer & Dryer, stainless steel sink & drainer and ample storage.\r\n\r\nStudy: - \r\nSolid wooden floor and bespoke built in solid work station.\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: - \r\nDouble bedroom with Solid wood floor, full length window.\nEn-suite: Tiled floors & walls with three piece suite.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Living room - \r\nThe heart of this home is a bespoke, Italian-designed Scavolini kitchen, meticulously curated for culinary enthusiasts and effortless entertaining. At its centre sits a commanding 3.5m x 1.2m chef’s island, complete with an integrated Liebherr wine cooler and Nexus SE double oven range cooker, featuring a dedicated hot plate and high-output wok ring, and a prep sink with built in drainer.\nThis premium space is fully equipped with a suite of integrated, high-end appliances:\n\n* Bosch combination oven\n* Neff built-in coffee maker\n* 2 x Fisher & Paykel dishwashers\n* LG American-style fridge freezer with energy-saving Door-in-Door™️ technology\r\n\r\nSitting room: - \r\nThis is divided by a central wall and magnificent double sided feature gas fire with solid wood flooring and large window to the front and small window at the western side.\r\n\r\nDownstairs: Bedroom 1 - \r\n Large double bedroom with incredible views back over cork harbour. This room is extensively glazed and has sliding doors out to the rear garden. Another feature is the electric blinds.\nEn-suite: Tiled floors & walls and three piece suite.\nWalk in wardrobe : Fitted rails and built in storage.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: - \r\n Large double bedroom with solid wood floors and window overlooking large patio area.\nEn-suite: Tiled floors & walls and three piece suite.\nWalk in wardrobe:  Fitted rails and built in storage.\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 4: - \r\nLarge double bedroom with solid wooden floors & window overlooking back garden.\r\n\r\nBedroom 5 - \r\n Large double bedroom with solid wooden floors & sliding door overlooking large patio area.\r\n\r\nGym or Bedroom 6: - \r\n  Currently used as a gym and has solid wood flooring and window to the side.\nBathroom: Tiled floor & walls with four piece suite.\n\r\n\r\nOutside: - \r\nElectric gates, ample off street parking. Large garden to rear as well as large patio and two separate balconies. There is also a modern garden room that is wired and could be used as a home office.\n\r\n\r\n"
      },
